lie Nelson, the band was a way for her to play \"low-stakes\" gigs in New York City bars, covering Hank Williams and Kris Kristofferson just for the fun of it.\nX is a believer in the magic of the first take. Most of her debut album, Come Away With Me, consists of \"live\" demos. Her producers found that when they tried to \"perfect\" the tracks with more takes, they lost the intimate, smoky atmosphere that made her voice so captivating. She prefers the \"flaws\" of a live performance over studio polish. Id X", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-30T18:35:28Z", "username": "Das", "text": "Norah Jones", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-30T18:35:30Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Noraj", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-30T18:35:32Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Jones", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-30T18:35:37Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Norah", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-30T18:35:39Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Noraj Chopra?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-30T18:35:44Z", "username": "Prathamesh", "text": "Noraj dooba hai yaaro", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-30T18:35:49Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Thank you Das ab tiebreaker hoga ‎", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-30T18:35:51Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Sudipto gets Norah Jones finally", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-30T18:35:52Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Great quizzing by 